              "id": "5aa28bd6-2357-4bed-819d-bcf3f60a9865",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em><strong>Game Boys: Professional Videogaming's Rise from the Basement to the Big Time</strong></em> was written by Michael Kane, published by Viking Adult, June 19, 2008."
            },
            {
              "id": "fc271822-d567-4ad2-b202-d6bf8c7d412c",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "d7e1c055-dd88-4647-8f9c-8bfd1098475d",
              "type": "quote",
              "html": "<em>An inside look at the darker side of the competitive video-game industry traces the rivalries between such companies as 3D and CompLexity, describes the world of professional elite players, and evaluates videogaming as a big-money intersection between business and pop culture.</em>"
